# CODEOWNERS — who must review a change before it can merge.
#
# Purpose:
#   * Required approvals come from these owners once branch protection is
#     enabled ("Require review from Code Owners").
#   * Owners are auto-subscribed to PRs touching their paths.
#
# Policy: the @img-man/maintainers team is the single catch-all owner.
# Add narrower rules here when new teams/subsystems exist — the more
# specific path always wins, so a line like `/src/lib/storage/ @img-man/storage-team`
# would take precedence over the defaults below.
#
# The team must exist in the GitHub org before these entries are actionable.

# Default ownership
* @img-man/maintainers

# Application code
/src/ @img-man/maintainers
/packages/ @img-man/maintainers

# Infrastructure and deployment
/scripts/ @img-man/maintainers
/Dockerfile @img-man/maintainers
/docker-compose.yml @img-man/maintainers
/next.config.mjs @img-man/maintainers

# Governance and meta
/LICENSE @img-man/maintainers
/GOVERNANCE.md @img-man/maintainers
/.github/ @img-man/maintainers
